  1050 				; edge is horizontally mirrored (pal 1,0 instead of 0,1) so the right-hand
  1051 				; copy reads as a flipped reflection of the left-hand one; the underlying
  1052 				; pixel data (Menu_Demo_Dest_Table) is untouched, only which palette
  1053 				; register each cell points at changes.
