  1677 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1678 				; Palette on/off.  Pal_Off bit n = palette n switched off: all 256 entries
  1679 				; 0,0,0 (its cells go black).  One state for every view; a palette that is on
  1680 				; comes from the current source (Load_Pal):
  1681 				;   Map_View  = 1 -> solid Map_View_Colours (the key-5 map view)
  1682 				;   Pal_Image = 1 -> the image's .PAL block at $21000
  1683 				;   otherwise     -> the menu's own: text palette at VBXE $00800, R/G/B ramps
  1684 				; Key 4, key 5 and a new image turn every palette back on.
  1685 				;  Pal_Solo   - keys 0-3: only palette X on
  1686 				;  Pal_Toggle - Shift+0-3: palette X off <-> on
  1687 				;  Pal_All    - 4 on the P screen: every palette on
  1688 				;  In: X = palette 0-3
