   906 				;=============================================================================
   907 				; Selector status line (row 20) - the highlighted image's description (typed
   908 				; in the converter, default = source filename without extension; up to
   909 				; NFO_NAME_CAP = 75 chars).  Reading a file per row stuttered a fresh
   910 				; directory, so instead the converter writes all the descriptions once into
   911 				; "IMAGES.LST" (8-byte key + description per record) beside the images.  Nfo_Name_LoadManifest slurps that in one pass on every
   912 				; Rescan_Images into NFO_NAME_VRAM (NFO_NAME_SLOT bytes/ordinal); the draw path
   913 				; is then a pure VRAM read.  No IMAGES.LST -> every slot stays $00 -> the line
   914 				; is simply blank.
   915 				;=============================================================================
   916
   917 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   918 				; Nfo_Name_ClearCache - blitter-wipe NFO_NAME_VRAM to $00 (every slot "no
   919 				; name").  Kicks BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR and waits (Nfo_Name_LoadManifest fills
   920 				; after).
   921 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   922 567A			Nfo_Name_ClearCache
   923 567A A9 BD			lda #BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR-BLT_CLEAR
   924 567C				vbsta VBXE_BL_ADR0
Macro: VBSTA [Source: vbxe_min.asm]
