  2144 				;=============================================================================
  2145 				; P-preview screen keys (UI_Mode = 6) - Esc; 0-3 = only that palette on,
  2146 				; Shift+0-3 = that palette off/on, 4 = all back on (Pal_Solo / Pal_Toggle / Pal_All,
  2147 				; view1024.asm - image, map-colour or menu palettes).  Every other key is ignored, Ctrl+0-3
  2148 				; included (Space/Backspace/5 have no meaning here, unlike the real
  2149 				; image-view key set - see Selector_Handle_P).
