  2183 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2184 				; Selector_Handle_I - load the selected image's "<name>.NFO" and open the info
  2185 				; viewer (UI_Mode 4).  "Reading nfo..." shows in row 0 during the load; the
  2186 				; info screen is then built in the back buffer and shown by Read_Key_Done in
  2187 				; one blit.  Missing file -> row 0 restored, selector stays up.  A directory /
  2188 				; ".." row has no .NFO - ignored, no disk access.
  2189 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2190 5E95			Selector_Handle_I
  2191 5E95 AD 8B 04			lda ImageCount
