  2878 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2879 				; Path_Save_Last_Segment - Up_Name = Scan_Path's last "SEG>", space-padded to
  2880 				; 8 like an IMAGE_BANK record (all spaces if Scan_Path is empty).  Called just
